/-!
# Checked color certificate for the symmetric outer HS centralizer

Start with the fixed-point coloring of `symmetricPermutation` and refine by
neighbor-color counts. Individualizing `4, 13, 15, 46, 54, 0, 1, 2` gives orbit
bounds `30, 7, 6, 2, 2, 4, 2, 2`. The final coloring is injective, so the
full graph centralizer has order at most 80,640. Every table identity and
refinement implication is checked by Lean's kernel.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith 16.1.5(10), p.1172; GLS3 Table 5.3m, class 2D.
Candidate discovery and transcription are retained in `../source/`.
-/

@[expose] public section

